   "text": "Years ago, our wonderful ambassador, Daniel, learned about Watsi while he was interning at a VC firm, and when he went back to school at Stony Brook that fall, he basically just started a chapter himself. He rallied some friends, threw events, got people donating, and turned out other students wanted to do exactly the same thing at their own schools.",
